					"content": "這樣彼此分開還是第一次。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091122
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091122,
					"content": "#嗯…我一直都能理解{F#妳}{M#你}的心情，如果連分別的理由都弄不清楚的話，就太難過了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091123,
					"content": "#我、我一定會好好當{F#妳}{M#你}的嚮導的，真相也總會揭開的。嗯！看著吧，天理！看著吧，提瓦特！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091124,
						80091125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091124,
					"content": "看著吧，天理！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091126,
					"content": "#欸嘿，都怪我提了這些讓{F#妳}{M#你}傷心的事，還是開心一點吧，{F#妳}{M#你}不開心的話…我也要難過了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091127,
						80091128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091127,
					"content": "沒關係，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091129,
					"content": "#好啦好啦，天色這麼晚了，不然{F#妳}{M#你}先休息吧？今天晚上我來站哨，不會讓魔物把{F#妳}{M#你}吃了的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091130,
					"content": "真難得，居然不是妳先睡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091131
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091131,
					"content": "#哎呀，別這麼說嘛…我偶爾也想照顧一下{F#妳}{M#你}的心情啦，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091132,
						80091133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091132,
					"content": "好吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091134,
					"content": "晚安晚安！快睡吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 80091133,
					"content": "那就晚安，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091128,
					"content": "謝謝妳，派蒙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091129
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091125,
					"content": "看著吧，提瓦特！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80091126
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80091121,
					"content": "至少…我想知道究竟發生了什麼。",
